    "text_with_media_ikUQBL": {
      "type": "text-with-media",
      "blocks": {
        "subheading_bmtjDE": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "A JOURNEY THAT INSPIRES",
            "position": "top_left"
          }
        },
        "heading_y3jzKP": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<strong>Lionel Messi  “A Napkin. A Signature. History.”<\/strong>",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "position": "top_left",
            "highlight_effect": "default",
            "highlight_accent_color": "",
            "highlight_text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "richtext_NT7QmM": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Age 13, a paper napkin carried the first signature of belief in Lionel Messi’s future.<br\/> This collectible transforms that beginning into a design language of legacy.<\/p><p>The textured Argentina relief map traces the nation that shaped him, while Rosario stands marked as the birthplace of a player who changed football forever. The golden football element represents football immortality, balanced against a minimalist white composition inspired by modern museum presentation.<\/p><p>Finished with Messi’s signature and individually numbered in a strictly limited edition. A collectible designed for the era that witnessed greatness in real time.<\/p>",
            "position": "top_left"
          }
        },
        "button_Yb7jzA": {
          "type": "button",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
